Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.56,0:21:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,0)\blur1.5\an8\fs56\3c&H000000&\3a&H5D&}本字幕由喵萌奶茶屋制作  仅供交流试看之用  请勿用于商业用途\N翻译：飞鱼　校对：Nemeton　后期：MIR
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dialogue
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,右转
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.01,0:00:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,前面的通道就是出口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.32,0:00:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我来切断电源 打开屏障
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.78,0:00:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,只有五秒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.12,0:00:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.50,0:00:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,彼岸
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.84,0:02:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.78,0:02:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,鞠死了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.99,0:02:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是山路下令的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.39,0:02:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,与死者残影嬉戏之人 将沉沦于无明
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.04,0:02:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你会死
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.18,0:02:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.22,0:02:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不像{\fsp8}是{\r}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}前员工的住处啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.59,0:02:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他真的在这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.26,0:02:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,位置肯定是这里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.48,0:02:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他在职时没有公开发表的成果
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.80,0:02:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,应该不是个大牛研究员
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.89,0:02:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不过他会藏到这种地方来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.36,0:02:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,可能真的掌握了重要信息
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.34,0:02:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,如果白忙活了 就再找些情报给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.54,0:02:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不能白请你吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.69,0:03:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 你会再请客的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.59,0:03:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不过前辈的动向应该被FBI监视了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.86,0:03:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,所以有紧急情况时再联系吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.21,0:03:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.18,0:03:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,那你多小心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.07,0:03:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,有能玩的游戏吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.95,0:03:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.98,0:03:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你是杰森·卡德纳斯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.35,0:03:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,防御系统故障引发的电源断开只有五秒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.96,0:03:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,从他流畅的动作能看出是有计划的入侵
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.57,0:03:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,故障原因是?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.37,0:03:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,正在解析 可能有人协助
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.51,0:03:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这些事都无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.90,0:03:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他来就开干
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.54,0:04:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,让那帮叛忍们好好看看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.88,0:04:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,方案不变
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.83,0:04:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,还不清楚彼岸的奥义
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.48,0:04:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,多余之举会成坏招
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.80,0:04:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那我这个计划如何
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.84,0:04:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,让他进城
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.72,0:04:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的力量汇集于此
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.02,0:04:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,大家一起上 揍扁他
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.51,0:04:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他那狗屁奥义也派不上用场吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.08,0:04:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,在城内作战有高风险
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.78,0:04:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,出现损失会波及整{\fsp8}个{\r}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.71,0:04:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,系统故障该怪谁呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.51,0:04:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好了好了 不也挺好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.74,0:04:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这方案不错 出了事全算在我头上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.16,0:04:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那么要引他进总部的测试房吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.56,0:04:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这样好 这下能拿到最棒的数据了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.84,0:04:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我得到情报了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.73,0:04:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,据说组织决定放你进城
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.47,0:04:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 这是陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.17,0:05:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你的对手是组织的干部忍者们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.49,0:05:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这邀请是为了确保杀死你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.34,0:05:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,别去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.77,0:05:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我要去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.34,0:05:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杀了山路
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.31,0:05:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,让组织的忍者们遭受报应
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.59,0:05:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我是为此而来的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.43,0:05:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这是难得的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.72,0:05:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,1{\fsp8}9{\r}点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.16,0:05:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那时城里会开始游行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.47,0:05:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,为了掩盖和你的战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.56,0:05:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.15,0:05:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你… 你会把我出卖{\fsp8}给{\r}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.79,0:05:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会做那种事 只是想请你协助搜查
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.08,0:05:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我你知道什么就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.61,0:05:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我的匿名应该是没问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.42,0:05:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,难道层数不够
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.55,0:05:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不会连协议都被解析了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.96,0:05:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我完了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.39,0:05:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好怀念这游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.25,0:06:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,小时候经常玩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.43,0:06:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,把它挪开
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.38,0:06:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.98,0:06:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这里做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.74,0:06:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,三 二 一
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.62,0:07:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.47,0:07:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,用于黑客活动的机房 有模有样的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.41,0:07:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我要干趴那个公司
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.78,0:07:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然小瞧我 贬低我 无视我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.48,0:07:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,什么叫自愿离职
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.67,0:07:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,明明是被他们逼得辞职的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.82,0:07:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶 可恶 可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.93,0:07:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不是你性格的问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.33,0:07:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 是他们嫉恨我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.63,0:07:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这是为还{\fsp8}击{\r}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}做的准备吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.91,0:08:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,应该不是个大牛研究员
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.43,0:08:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,似乎也不是那样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.77,0:08:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道他们在做些可疑的事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.26,0:08:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,可没人相信
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.76,0:08:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我会揪出那些事 并告诸世界
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.31,0:08:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.30,0:08:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,放手做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.41,0:08:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想收{\fsp8}拾{\r}AUZ{\fsp8}A
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.48,0:08:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你能黑进他们的服务器吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.62,0:08:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}的安全措施很严密
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.98,0:08:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,被发现的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.99,0:08:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,放心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.88,0:08:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我会保护你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.26,0:09:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我没法让他们服务器宕机
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.54,0:09:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,可以了 能拿到点情报就行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.35,0:09:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,继续
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.73,0:09:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是技术开发部的服务器
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.58,0:09:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这是… 看时间应该是最新的研究报告
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.43,0:09:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,是交给投资公司用的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.41,0:09:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不是什么有用情报 再深入些吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.87,0:10:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.54,0:10:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这是 系统源代码
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.02,0:10:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我想要的数据 找下别处
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.05,0:10:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那这里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.96,0:10:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,公司内网服务器
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.94,0:10:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候信息就留在这种地方
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.55,0:10:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Bound?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.83,0:10:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,职员名单 还是顾客信息?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.79,0:10:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不 是社会安全号码
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.75,0:10:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,身份号码 还有价格…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.36,0:10:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在买个人的身份证明?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.52,0:10:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 大公司常做的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.81,0:10:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,用来雇佣间谍
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.52,0:10:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Boun{\fsp8}d{\r}是那个组织的名字吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.08,0:10:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,还有管理员的信息
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.85,0:10:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,被我发现了 腐败{\fsp8}的{\r}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.85,0:11:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不是有关忍者的数据 没那么顺利…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.06,0:11:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,艾玛 她的名字怎么出现在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.36,0:11:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你认识?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.68,0:11:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.82,0:11:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,估计是同名吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.35,0:11:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.69,0:11:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,遭了 暴露了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.54,0:11:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}发现服务器被黑了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.52,0:11:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这边也有人来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.02,0:11:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.02,0:12:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,FB{\fsp8}I{\r}联系他们了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.58,0:12:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那些人是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.48,0:12:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fsp8}是{\r}AUZ{\fsp8}A{\r}请的佣兵吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.27,0:12:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我的基地啊 可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.87,0:12:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,到底怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.12,0:13:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,后面
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.04,0:13:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,就不能开快点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.24,0:13:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,已经是这辆破车的极限了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.13,0:13:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,要命
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.47,0:13:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,刹车
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.80,0:13:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你好强啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.79,0:13:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,低头
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.49,0:15:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.80,0:15:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你的眼神 和我想的一样诱人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.57,0:15:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,想不到你能来到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.58,0:15:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好 让我见识一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.37,0:15:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,开始测试
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.25,0:15:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,山路
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.31,0:15:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,山路
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.60,0:16:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,得了吧 落伍的旧时代玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.57,0:16:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,山路
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.02,0:16:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.61,0:16:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,等我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.23,0:16:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,以后再也别用了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.23,0:16:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,下次你会死的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.05,0:16:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这就去见你们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.01,0:17:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我等这一刻好久了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.86,0:17:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,让我听听你那可爱声音
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.97,0:17:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,找到…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.79,0:17:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,朝阳起 湖面平静泛波光
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.79,0:18:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.58,0:18:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.83,0:18:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,传得好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.77,0:18:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,真无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.49,0:18:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这就结束了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.86,0:19:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你明白了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.98,0:19:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,指引你的 是地狱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.30,0:19:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,山路
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.94,0:19:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,山路
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.67,0:19:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,山路
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.90,0:19:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,就此结束吧
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Screen
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,ED
Comment: 0,0:21:41.66,0:21:45.16,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}As the memories fade away
Comment: 0,0:21:46.79,0:21:50.50,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}The lives of those who weren’t saved
Comment: 0,0:21:52.17,0:21:55.75,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Regret and torment has come to stay
Comment: 0,0:21:56.42,0:22:00.51,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Hopelessly leading us astray
Comment: 0,0:22:03.05,0:22:08.18,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}On a journey to find some kind of reason
Comment: 0,0:22:08.18,0:22:13.10,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}The army’s weight is only crumbling
Comment: 0,0:22:13.69,0:22:17.65,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Haunted by the look of those who we’ve left behind
Comment: 0,0:22:17.65,0:22:22.86,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Close your eyes, try to leave the shame behind
Comment: 0,0:22:22.86,0:22:28.16,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Who will stay to lend a helping hand
Comment: 0,0:22:28.74,0:22:33.29,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}When death is knocking at the door
Comment: 0,0:22:33.67,0:22:38.63,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Who will fight alone for what is right
Comment: 0,0:22:39.30,0:22:43.30,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}For the ones who were left behind
Comment: 0,0:22:43.30,0:22:46.26,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,5,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Those who were left behind
Comment: 0,0:21:41.66,0:21:45.16,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}当记忆渐渐模糊
Comment: 0,0:21:46.79,0:21:50.50,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}那些未被挽救的生命
Comment: 0,0:21:52.17,0:21:55.75,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}后悔与折磨长留心中
Comment: 0,0:21:56.42,0:22:00.51,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}使我们绝望迷失
Comment: 0,0:22:03.05,0:22:08.18,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}在寻找理由的旅途之中
Comment: 0,0:22:08.18,0:22:13.10,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}当队伍开始分崩离析
Comment: 0,0:22:13.69,0:22:17.65,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}被抛弃之人的面庞挥之不去
Comment: 0,0:22:17.65,0:22:22.86,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}闭上眼睛想忘记愧疚
Comment: 0,0:22:22.86,0:22:28.16,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}谁会留下伸出援手
Comment: 0,0:22:28.74,0:22:33.29,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}当死亡已经近在咫尺
Comment: 0,0:22:33.67,0:22:38.63,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}谁会独自战斗追寻正义
Comment: 0,0:22:39.30,0:22:43.30,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}为那些被抛弃的人们
Comment: 0,0:22:43.30,0:22:46.26,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}那些被抛弃的人们
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
